  "about": "The offertorium of the formulary “Palm Sunday” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "My heart hath expected reproach and misery; and I looked for one that would grieve together with me, but there was none. I sought one that would comfort me, and I found none; they gave me gall for my food, and in my thirst they gave me vinegar to drink." }
